#: ../../../api.rst:201
msgid "Enables *debug/development* mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api.rst:205
msgid ""
"This mode purposely makes Highlight.js more fragile!  It should only be used "
"for testing and local development (of languages or the library itself)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api.rst:207
msgid ""
"For example, if a new version suddenly had a serious bug (or breaking "
"change) that affected only a single language:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api.rst:209
msgid ""
"**In Safe Mode** all other languages would continue to highlight just fine. "
"The broken language would appear as a code block, but without any "
"highlighting (as if it were plaintext)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api.rst:210
msgid ""
"**In Debug Mode** all highlighting would stop and a JavaScript error would "
"be thrown."
msgstr ""

